 manufacture of electric powertrains, battery packs, and components; and sales and after-sales management activities. Additionally, it operates in app NIO Auto Mall where users can select from various accessories and value added services; and online auction platform. The company was formerly known as NextEV Inc. and changed its name to NIO Inc. in July 2017. NIO Inc. was incorporated in 2014 and is headquartered in Shanghai, China.","web":"https://www.nio.com","empleados":35032.0,"precio_bloque":{"precio":2.8499999046325684,"r1m":-0.14156627652433673,"r3m":-0.3478260917006981,"r6m":-0.4910714369343253,"r12m":-0.48181819915771484,"ytd":-0.44552529597997503,"r12m_spy":0.09060114697421295,"mom12_1":-0.39636364850130945,"vs_ma200":-0.39783857835303693,"max52":6.869999885559082,"vs_max52":-0.5851528453991183,"vol1y":0.5146336424901703,"beta":1.1280659240937774,"caida_max_5y":-0.9394463642332619,"serie":{"f":["2021-12-03","2021-12-10","2021-12-17","2021-12-24","2021-12-31","2022-01-07","2022-01-14","2022-01-21","2022-01-28","2022-02-04","2022-02-11","2022-02-18","2022-02-25","2022-03-04","2022-03-11","2022-03-18","2022-03-25","2022-04-01","2022-04-08","2022-04-15","2022-04-22","2022-04-29","2022-05-06","2022-05-13","2022-05-20","2022-05-27","2022-06-03","2022-06-10","2022-06-17","2022-06-24","2022-07-01","2022-07-08","2022-07-15","2022-07-22","2022-07-29","2022-08-05","2022-08-12","2022-08-19","2022-08-26","2022-09-02","2022-09-09","2022-09-16","2022-09-23","2022-09-30","2022-10-07","2022-10-14","2022-10-21","2022-10-28","2022-11-04","2022-11-11","2022-11-18","2022-11-25","2022-12-02","2022-12-09","2022-12-16","2022-12-23","2022-12-30","2023-01-06","2023-01-13","2023-01-20","2023-01-27","2023-02-03","2023-02-10","2023-02-17","2023-02-24","2023-03-03","2023-03-10","2023-03-17","2023-03-24","2023-03-31","2023-04-07","2023-04-14","2023-04-21","2023-04-28","2023-05-05","2023-05-12","2023-05-19","2023-05-26","2023-06-02","2023-06-09","2023-06-16","2023-06-23","2023-06-30","202